WEBVTT

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:45.220
It's noon already.
Time for a break.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:01.830
Chief! Let's play!

00:02:02.310 --> 00:02:03.300
Let's play!

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:05.410
Where's your mama?

00:02:07.810 --> 00:02:09.680
I see. She's still sleeping.

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:14.120
So you haven't had lunch yet?

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.600
Okay. Why don't we go out
and have some lunch?

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.100
What shall we have?

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.710
M-Mitaka?

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.940
Is that good?

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:04.030
Um..

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:11.690
Say,

00:03:12.590 --> 00:03:13.310
What?!

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:17.310
What? You're the one
who was waiting to see me.

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:22.880
I sort of know
how you must be feeling.

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:27.060
Do you?! You know
how I'm feeling?

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:31.030
Mrs. Ichinose told me

00:03:31.730 --> 00:03:34.560
that it was her dog
that was pregnant.

00:03:36.310 --> 00:03:37.600
Let's not talk about it

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:42.720
You're not thinking about
calling off the engagement?

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.000
You know I can't do that

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:46.410
Good.

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:48.380
What do you mean, "good"?!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.620
I-I'd feel sorry
for Asuna if you did.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:55.540
What about me?
Don't you feel sorry for me?

00:03:55.870 --> 00:04:01.600
You must have gotten
engaged to her

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:05.460
because you thought
the baby was yours.

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:08.340
I only kissed her!!

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.730
Anyway, it's too late.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:27.590
So what are you going to do?

00:04:30.490 --> 00:04:32.330
Now that we know that
the whole pregnancy thing

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.610
was a misunderstanding.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:36.830
there's a chance for him
to make a comeback.

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.660
What are you talking about?

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.730
Mitaka! Let's
run away together!

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:47.730
Say it, and he's yours.

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.970
Why are you always
thinking of ways

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.840
to destroy other
people's happiness?

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.610
I wonder.

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.950
Is Mitaka happy?

00:04:57.030 --> 00:05:00.150
I'm sure he's been
through some rough times.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.090
Mitaka's not himself lately.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.650
He hasn't cracked
a smile in a while.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:22.160
There's no turning back now.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:26.280
I'm not marrying Asuna
just for the hell of it.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:28.950
But.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.240
It's Manager, isn't it?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.400
I've come to realize..

00:05:42.700 --> 00:05:44.620
that I'm not the man.

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:48.700
the man she needs in her life.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:58.400
I don't know if Manager
needs me or not.

00:05:59.110 --> 00:06:02.870
I'm not very
responsible or worthy.

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.650
You sure are irresponsible
and unworthy.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.220
But I'm doing my best!

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:10.350
You better be, idiot!

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:14.320
If only you were at least
a little capable,

00:06:14.660 --> 00:06:17.400
I wouldn't have to waste
my time coming to see you!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.360
The truth is,

00:06:24.170 --> 00:06:27.200
you're the last person
I want to see now!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.100
But.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.960
Now that there's
nothing more I can do

00:06:36.030 --> 00:06:36.960
for Ms. Otonashi

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.300
Mitaka...

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:43.350
Do you understand
what I'm saying?!

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.550
Why should I have to
give you a pep talk?!

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:52.570
I'm sorry.

00:06:57.370 --> 00:06:58.270
Chief!

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.600
I'm bored!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.220
Let's play!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.010
Let's play, Chief!

00:07:06.160 --> 00:07:07.280
I'm sorry.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.580
I'm talking to this man about
something really important.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:12.870
Can you play by yourselves
a little bit longer?

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:13.980
I'm done here.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:15.890
I'm leaving.

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.450
Asuna's coming over
to my place tonight.

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.550
Mitaka!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:28.100
Maybe I haven't earned the right
to say something like this.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:32.430
Please make Asuna happy.

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:39.580
You haven't got the right

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:59.330
I didn't know you were
such a great cook, Asuna.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:00.760
Please.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:02.920
She's right.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:07.360
I'm so happy for you.
She'll be a perfect bride.

00:08:07.450 --> 00:08:08.210
Yes.

00:08:09.820 --> 00:08:12.430
Wouldn't it be nice to have
some grandchildren soon?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:15.540
No need to rush.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.410
With Shun, you never know.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.170
By the time they
tie the knot,

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:25.050
they may already have
a bun in the oven!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:28.320
Uncle!

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.970
Maybe if that were the case,

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.720
it would have been
easier to swallow.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.310
Do you not like it?

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.730
You're not eating very much.

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:46.810
Please! I love it!

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:48.950
I mean it!

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:54.610
I have to keep smiling.

00:09:03.130 --> 00:09:07.860
It's been so long since we've
looked at Shun's albums.

00:09:09.470 --> 00:09:10.490
So cute.

00:09:11.470 --> 00:09:13.840
He hasn't changed much,
has he?

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:14.990
I haven't?

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:17.760
There are a lot
of tennis photos.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:21.540
He's been absorbed in tennis
since middle school.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.180
So young?

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:33.290
That? That's when
I was in ninth grade,

00:09:33.360 --> 00:09:34.850
during a championship.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.190
Did you win?

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:39.860
No, that was taken
after I lost.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:45.100
Really? You're smiling.

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.210
I didn't know
what else to do.

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:52.230
Normally, one would
look more disappointed.

00:09:52.880 --> 00:09:55.580
He's always
been cheerful

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:06.690
No one knows how much
I cried after that.

00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:22.250
Are you exhausted?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:23.230
No.

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:27.080
So this is your room..

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:30.760
I lived here until
I graduated from college.

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.140
It's the way I left it.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:57.230
A man's room is
rather dull, isn't it?

00:10:57.590 --> 00:10:59.050
Your second-place trophy.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:02.880
This didn't make you

00:11:02.960 --> 00:11:04.850
as happy as a first-place trophy
would have.

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.050
No.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.250
People are capable...

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:14.330
of smiling even
when they're not happy.

00:11:16.260 --> 00:11:16.820
Huh?

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:25.630
You looked very different in
the photo of you holding this.

00:11:28.140 --> 00:11:28.800
And.

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:36.180
And you look the same way tonight.

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.690
N-No.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:48.020
What can I do?

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:52.570
It's nothing
you need to worry about

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:55.060
Please don't cry.

00:11:56.810 --> 00:12:00.710
A fishmonger cheered.

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.230
Wahoo! Just joking.

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:14.190
I-I'm sorry! Please forget
what I Just said!

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.270
I-I

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:19.250
I just wanted
to make you smile.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.970
You don't have to
force yourself to laugh.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.810
You're right.
Let's just be ourselves.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:47.290
Let's take our time
and be happy.

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:53.250
After all, you and I

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:55.390
are going to spend...

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.840
a lifetime together.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:04.430
Yes.

00:13:07.470 --> 00:13:09.710
Good-bye, Ms. Otonashi.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:40.310
Hi!

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:43.270
You're done with all
your exams now, right?

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.320
I just have to turn in
my senior thesis.

00:13:47.190 --> 00:13:47.950
Great!

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:51.790
I just got my bonus today, so
let's go out and celebrate.

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:52.920
yay!

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:55.480
It's great to have
a reliable older friend!

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:01.560
You're finally becoming
a working member of society.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:05.320
Pleasure to meet you.
I'm Kozue Nanao of Toto Bank.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.140
This is all the money I have.

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:14.140
Wow! You're pretty rich!

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.280
I've been saving away
since I was a little boy.

00:14:17.840 --> 00:14:21.140
It's not that I was saving
for anything in particular.

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:24.870
But I think it's about time
to spend it all

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.280
How brave.

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:32.220
And I'd love it
if you would help me.

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:38.400
Please.

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.460
Won't you do a wedding with me?

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.110
Do you understand
what I'm saying?

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.320
Please think about it.

00:15:07.330 --> 00:15:11.640
I never knew he liked me
since high school.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:17.280
He's a nice man,
but a marriage proposal...?

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:41.350
See you, Godai.
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.720
Yes! Good night!

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:57.140
Welcome back.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:15:59.410
What are you all doing?

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:01.700
Please don't drink
in the entry area

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:02.910
in the middle of the day!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:05.920
We've been waiting
for you, Manager.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.470
This is the amulet the old man
carries around

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.320
when he goes Job-hunting.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.820
It's not very effective,
but here.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.070
Here's an energy drink.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:19.560
Too much will give you
a bloody nose, so be careful

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:24.500
Here's a sardine head.
Drives away evil

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.910
What am I supposed
to do with these?

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:33.330
Godai's taking his
graduation finals, right?

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.790
So why give me these?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.520
We're giving you reasons
to go see him,

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:41.390
so why don't you go?

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.850
Why me?

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:49.450
Now that you've let
Mitaka slip away.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.790
You can no longer be picky.

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:54.900
At least, he's a man.

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:56.820
It's none of your business.

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.090
Hello!

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.700
What a surprise!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:02.490
Kozue?

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:06.200
Is Godai here?

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.740
Lucky!

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:20.950
Godai's at a cabaret?

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:21.660
Yes.

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:23.520
Why?

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.790
He's got his reasons.

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:30.430
He never mentioned it.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:35.460
You've been seeing him
occasionally, haven't you?

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:39.240
Yes, but not lately.

00:17:41.360 --> 00:17:42.340
I see.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.620
So they've been seeing
each other occasionally.

00:17:57.530 --> 00:17:58.370
Godai?

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.160
Is it time to go
pass out the flyers?

00:18:01.770 --> 00:18:03.830
Why you little--!

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:05.300
Godai?

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:07.460
Kozue?

00:18:07.680 --> 00:18:08.720
And Manager?

00:18:12.660 --> 00:18:14.680
Why are you here?

00:18:15.450 --> 00:18:19.810
You haven't called me
in a long time.

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.750
Why are Kozue and
Manager here together?

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:27.510
So which one's
your "you-know"?

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:30.870
Please! Not so loud!

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:32.990
Godai?

00:18:33.640 --> 00:18:34.600
Y-Yes?

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:36.830
Here.

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.160
What are these?

00:18:38.580 --> 00:18:41.030
They're from the gang
at Maison.

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:46.200
I just came to
deliver these.

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:48.700
Bye.

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:49.800
Wait!

00:18:50.250 --> 00:18:51.650
How about some tea?

00:18:51.720 --> 00:18:55.050
Yes, Manager.
You came all the way here.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:56.150
But.

00:18:57.700 --> 00:19:00.750
It's not a nice place,
but make yourself at home.

00:19:17.190 --> 00:19:19.680
Kozue, so what
brought you here today?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:25.240
Actually, I wanted to talk
to you about something.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:29.240
Godai, why don't you go to
a coffee shop or something?

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:31.810
But.

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:37.730
Please don't mind me.
I'm leaving.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:46.930
Thank you, Manager.

00:19:56.720 --> 00:19:58.010
Please.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:19:59.380
Lunch...

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.810
You're the one

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.190
who made those lunches
for him, aren't you?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.590
Yes.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:12.090
I knew it. I didn't think
it was that other girl

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:14.910
What about it?

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:18.600
It's really not
my place to say,

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:22.270
but maybe you should
give him some space.

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:27.580
I think he's trying
too hard to live up to you.

00:20:28.860 --> 00:20:29.710
Please..

00:20:31.090 --> 00:20:33.580
We're not like that.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.290
Then why did you
make lunches for him?

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:38.860
well-

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.980
No need to hide it from me.

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:45.720
I'm not hiding anything.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:50.100
Anyway, he's going back
to the apartment

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.940
after he's done
with his exams.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:57.530
Please be kind to him.

00:20:57.710 --> 00:21:01.910
Of course. There's no reason
I should be mean to him.

00:21:03.890 --> 00:21:07.500
As if I'm the one
pressuring Godai!

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.950
What? You're in
the midst of finals?

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:17.440
It'll be over tomorrow.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:22.460
It's an important time
for you.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:25.640
Anyway, what did you
want to talk to me about?

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:31.480
I won't talk about it today.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:33.580
Why?

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.310
Forget it. I'll wait until
you're done with your finals.

00:21:36.430 --> 00:21:38.540
But you came all the way here.

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:44.040
Don't worry about me.
Good luck on your exams.

00:21:45.840 --> 00:21:46.550
Right.

00:21:53.970 --> 00:21:56.730
Why did I bother coming?

00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:00.500
Godai left right away
with Kozue.

00:22:01.470 --> 00:22:02.490
I Feel like an idiot.

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:06.440
Now it's bothering me.

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.910
Don't let it.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:09.920
It's not that big a deal.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:15.160
It was nice to see you.
It's been a while.

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:19.050
I may not be that dependable,

00:22:19.700 --> 00:22:22.020
but you can talk to me
about anything.

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:25.630
Would you do anything for me?

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:31.250
If it's something I can do.

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:42.500
Look here.

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:47.010
Close your eyes.

00:23:14.690 --> 00:23:15.510
Thank you.

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:17.390
Hey.

00:23:50.130 --> 00:23:51.810
He proposed?!

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:54.360
Yes. Godai proposed to Kozue.

00:23:54.560 --> 00:23:55.590
What's going on?

00:23:55.670 --> 00:23:57.330
You've got it all wrong!

00:23:58.440 --> 00:23:59.480
Manager?!

00:23:59.600 --> 00:24:03.540
Next: "Love Forlorn!
Today is IT for Godai and Kyoko"

00:24:03.640 --> 00:24:05.960
We can't help you anymore!
